Author: CusDeb OS Team
Description: Resize the desktop window on WM_DISPLAYCHANGE.
 When the display resolution changes, the Progman desktop window must
 refresh its size and the shell view work area. Without this, the taskbar
 updates correctly but the desktop leaves an uncovered strip where the
 underlying window manager shows through.
